		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33CBE187D3DF4EA8"]
			description: ["The &6MOCVD Reactor&r grows indium gallium arsenide layer by layer for the &6Pump Modules&r. Fibre, pumps and a grating make a &6Fibre Laser Module&r. The reactor's spare arsine goes to the scrubber, never the air."]
			icon: "gtceu:mocvd_reactor"
