		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7D5E30D919EC171F"]
			description: ["UV's superconductor won't draw like a normal wire. The &6Powder-in-Tube Line&r packs its powder into silver tubes and draws the lot, and the silver comes back. It's the only place that wire is made now."]
			icon: "gtceu:powder_in_tube_line"
