		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1AA12DFECDEFD309"]
			description: ["The &6Neptune Deep Siphon&r drops a scoop through the methane deck for hydrogen rich in deuterium, and helium with a trace of helium-3. That helium also grows the &6Neptunian Quantum Seed&r, so pipes reach home."]
			icon: "gtceu:neptune_deep_siphon"
