		{
			dependencies: ["762C4669D260B0F2"]
			description: ["Triton's nitrogen is rich in &6Nitrogen-15&r. Burn it to nitric oxide, let the cryogenic plant sort out the heavy kind and reduce it back. Thorium nitride made with it breeds better, and the pyroprocessing cell hands the nitrogen back."]
